  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Peptide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A sheer, tinted lipstick with a subtle, juicy sheen that has a clean, swipe-and-go formula with buildable color and the cushion-soft comfort of a balm.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lip Balm <br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Peptides: Attracts moisture like a magnet and visibly plumps lips.<br>- Seaweed Extracts and Ceramides: Helps firm and smooth lips. <b><br></b>- Kokum and Seed Butters: Rich in essential fatty acids to soothe and lock in moisture.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This cushiony, clean formula delivers a fresh wash of color, lasting hydration, and a refreshing, cooling sensation with every swipe. Glides on</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe directly onto bare lips for a touch of sheer color and a subtle sheen. <br>-For a more subtle look, one pass is all you need. <br>-For more color payoff, layer with a few more swipes.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hyaluronic Peptides: Attracts moisture like a magnet and visibly plumps lips.<br>-Seaweed Extracts and Ceramides: Helps firm and smooth lips. <b><br></b>-Kokum and Seed Butters: Rich in essential fatty acids to soothe and lock in moisture.<br><br>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Synthetic Wax, Diisostearyl Malate, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Polyglyceryl-2 Diisostearate, Bis-Behenyl/Isostearyl/Phytosteryl Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Synthetic Beeswax, Mica, Behenyl Alcohol, Lactic Acid/Glycolic Acid Copolymer, Stearalkonium Bentonite, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Garcinia Indica Seed Butter, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Ceramide NP, Sodium Hyaluronate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Tribehenin, Triolein, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Glyceryl Dioleate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Methyl Diisopropyl Propionamide, Dicalcium Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Propylene Carbonate, Lactic Acid, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Silica, Tin Oxide, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
